Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gir1.2-ayatanaappindicator3-0.1, udev
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Description: Lighting and battery control for the MCHOSE G87 keyboard
 Controls RGB lighting effects, brightness, speed and color of the
 MCHOSE G87 over its 2.4G receiver, and shows the battery level in the
 system tray. Includes a GTK settings window and the `mchose` CLI.
